<title>JAPAN: Gore leaves Tokyo for Beijing.</title>
<headline>Gore leaves Tokyo for Beijing.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Vice President Al Gore left Tokyo on Monday for Beijing, where he will hold talks on the future of U.S.-China relations.</p>
<p>Gore arrived in Japan on Sunday and spent 24 hours in Tokyo as part of an Asian tour that also includes South Korea.</p>
</text>
